{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hello大家好。好久好久不见了\nhello dàjiā hǎo. hǎojiǔ hǎojiǔbujiàn le\nHello everyone. It's been a long, long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5466,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我好久好久没有录vlog了\nwǒ hǎojiǔ hǎojiǔ méiyǒu lù vlog le\nI haven't recorded a vlog in ages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20266,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那这几天\nnà zhèjǐtiān\nSo, these past few days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21766,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我在进行一个短途旅行\nwǒ zài jìnxíng yígè duǎn tú lǔxíng\nI've been on a short trip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25800,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我在镇江\nwǒ zài zhènjiāng\nI'm in Zhenjiang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28666,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个地方在上海的西北部\nzhège dìfāng zài shànghǎi de xīběibù\nThis place is northwest of Shanghai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34566,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "离上海坐火车大概只要一个半小时\nlí shànghǎi zuò huǒchē dàgài zhǐyào yígè bànxiǎoshí\nIt's only about an hour and a half from Shanghai by train."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39066,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我住的酒店就在镇江\nwǒ zhù de jiǔdiàn jiù zài zhènjiāng\nThe hotel I'm staying at is right next to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42500,
    "dDurationMs": 2566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "最著名的一个景点旁边\nzuì zhùmíng de yígè jǐngdiǎn pángbiān\nZhenjiang's most famous scenic spot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45700,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个景点叫做西津渡\nzhège jǐngdiǎn jiàozuò xī jīn dù\nThis spot is called Xijindu — West Ferry Crossing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49100,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在古代是一个渡口\nzài gǔdài shì yígè dùkǒu\nIn ancient times it was a ferry crossing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52966,
    "dDurationMs": 4734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以镇江在古代其实挺重要的\nsuǒyǐ zhènjiāng zài gǔdài qíshí tǐng zhòngyào de\nso Zhenjiang was actually quite important back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58066,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我猜你们现在应该\ndàn wǒ cāi nǐmen xiànzài yīnggāi\nBut I'd guess that these days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60566,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "没有多少人听过这个城市\nméiyǒu duōshǎo rén tīng guò zhège chéngshì\nnot many of you have heard of this city."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64033,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以今天我就想带你们一起看一看\nsuǒyǐ jīntiān wǒ jiù xiǎng dài nǐmen yīqǐ kànyīkàn\nSo today I want to take you along to have a look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68500,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "西津渡现在是一个\nxī jīn dù xiànzài shì yígè\nXijindu is now a place"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71833,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "像商业古街一样的地方\nxiàng shāngyè gǔ jiē yīyàng de dìfāng\nrather like a commercial old street."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75066,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实这样的古街\nqíshí zhèyàng de gǔ jiē\nActually, old streets like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76633,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在在中国很多景点都非常常见\nxiànzài zài zhōngguó hěn duō jǐngdiǎn dōu fēicháng chángjiàn\nare very common at Chinese scenic spots nowadays,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81166,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而且很多看起来都很像\nérqiě hěn duō kànqǐlai dōu hěn xiàng\nand a lot of them look very much alike."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85366,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但好在今天是周一\ndàn hǎozài jīntiān shì zhōuyī\nBut luckily, today is Monday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89100,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和以前周末来旅游不一样\nhé yǐqián zhōumò lái lǔyóu bùyīyàng\nUnlike the weekend trips I used to take,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92633,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "人少很多\nrén shǎo hěn duō\nthere are far fewer people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95366,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但也不是特别特别少\ndàn yě bùshì tèbié tèbié shǎo\nThough not extremely few, either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98800,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以对我来说就有一种刚刚好的氛围\nsuǒyǐ duìwǒláishuō jiù yǒu yīzhǒng gānggang hǎo de fēnwéi\nSo for me there's a just-right atmosphere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104766,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那像这样一条老街\nnà xiàng zhèyàng yī tiáo lǎojiē\nAn old street like this one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107933,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在就主要是传统\nxiànzài jiù zhǔyào shì chuántǒng\nis now mainly a mix of traditional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110866,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "民居和一些商铺饭店\nmínjū hé yīxiē shāngpù fàndiàn\nhouses and some shops, restaurants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114833,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "民宿的结合\nmínsù de jiéhé\nand guesthouses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116766,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有很多民宿\nyǒu hěn duō mínsù\nThere are lots of guesthouses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118600,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "他们一楼是咖啡厅或者酒吧\ntāmen yī lóu shì kāfēitīng huòzhě jiǔbā\nTheir ground floor is a café or a bar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122666,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "二楼三楼或者更高的\nèr lóu sān lóu huòzhě gèng gāo de\nand the second, third or higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125333,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "楼层就是住宿的地方\nlóucéng jiùshì zhùsù de dìfāng\nfloors are where you stay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128866,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和很多地方一样\nhé hěn duō dìfāng yīyàng\nAs in many places,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130733,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里的星巴克也建成了\nzhèlǐ de xīngbākè yě jiànchéng le\nthe Starbucks here has also been built"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134633,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "和当地建筑风格匹配的样子\nhé dāngdì jiànzhù fēnggé pǐpèi de yàngzi\nto match the local architectural style."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140133,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "包括麦当劳也是\nbāokuò màidāngláo yě shì\nThe McDonald's too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143533,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在我的印象中\nzài wǒ de yìnxiàng zhōng\nAs I remember it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145333,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "肯德基做的本地化的尝试\nkěndéjī zuò de běndìhuà de chángshì\nKFC's attempts at localization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149966,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实是比麦当劳更多的\nqíshí shì bǐ màidāngláo gèng duō de\nare actually more numerous than McDonald's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152433,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我觉得这样的建筑设计应该也是\ndàn wǒ juéde zhèyàng de jiànzhù shèjì yīnggāi yě shì\nBut I think this kind of architectural design must also be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155633,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "麦当劳做的一个本地化的尝试吧\nmàidāngláo zuò de yígè běndìhuà de chángshì ba\none of McDonald's attempts at localizing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160866,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们看这里有一个小小的装饰\nnǐmen kàn zhèlǐ yǒu yígè xiǎoxiǎo de zhuāngshì\nLook, there's a little decoration here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166066,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个写的是篆书\nzhège xiě de shì zhuànshū\nThis is written in seal script."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169366,
    "dDurationMs": 1834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我大概能认出来\nwǒ dàgài néng rènchū lái\nI can just about make it out —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它写的就是“西津渡码头”\ntā xiě de jiùshì \"xī jīn dù mǎtóu\"\nit says \"Xijindu Wharf\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178433,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边有一座雕塑\nzhèbiān yǒu yī zuò diāosù\nThere's a sculpture over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181733,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我觉得应该就是以前码头的\nwǒ juéde yīnggāi jiùshì yǐqián mǎtóu de\nI think it must be modelled on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187166,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "码头的船夫的样子\nmǎtóu de chuánfū de yàngzi\nthe boatmen of the old wharf."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191766,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这一块特别安静\nzhè yīkuài tèbié ānjìng\nThis corner is especially quiet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195233,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里眼前就是一片绿意\nzhèlǐ yǎnqián jiùshì yī piàn lǜ yì\nRight in front of us is a stretch of green."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199766,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果我们看到眼前有\nrúguǒ wǒmen kàn dào yǎnqián yǒu\nWhen we see before us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202400,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一大片绿色的植物\nyī dàpiàn lùsè de zhíwù\na great expanse of green plants,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205166,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一大片绿色的自然的景观\nyī dàpiàn lùsè de zìrán de jǐngguān\na great expanse of green natural scenery,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207866,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们就可以说眼前有一片绿意\nwǒmen jiù kěyǐ shuō yǎnqián yǒu yī piàn lǜ yì\nwe can say there's \"a stretch of green\" before our eyes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211833,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是比较诗意的说法\nzhè shì bǐjiào shīyì de shuōfa\nIt's a rather poetic way of putting it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214966,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是古街我今天想带你们就看到这里\ndànshì gǔ jiē wǒ jīntiān xiǎng dài nǐmen jiù kàn dào zhèlǐ\nBut that's as much of the old street as I'll show you today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220000,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我要去一个我更期待的地方\nxiànzài wǒ yào qù yígè wǒ gèng qīdài de dìfāng\nNow I'm off to a place I'm looking forward to even more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224366,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "也希望是一个更安静的地方\nyě xīwàng shì yígè gèng ānjìng de dìfāng\nand hopefully a quieter one too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229366,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好的，现在我们到了\nhǎo de, xiànzài wǒmen dàoliǎo\nAll right, we've arrived."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232466,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们今天的第二个地方\nwǒmen jīntiān de dìèr gè dìfāng\nThis is our second stop today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235266,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个地方叫焦山\nzhège dìfāng jiào jiāo shān\nThis place is called Jiaoshan — Jiao Mountain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237866,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是后面那座山\njiùshì hòumiàn nà zuò shān\nIt's that mountain behind me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们现在要等渡船过来\nwǒmen xiànzài yào děng dùchuán guòlai\nNow we have to wait for the ferry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243133,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "接我们去那座山\njiē wǒmen qù nà zuò shān\nto take us over to the mountain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246000,
    "dDurationMs": 4466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实镇江有三座比较有名的山\nqíshí zhènjiāng yǒu sān zuò bǐjiào yǒumíng de shān\nZhenjiang actually has three fairly famous mountains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251133,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我选这里是因为这座山\ndànshì wǒ xuǎn zhèlǐ shì yīnwèi zhè zuò shān\nbut I chose this one because it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255433,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是唯一一座在长江中的山\nshì wéiyī yī zuò zài chángjiāng zhòngdì shān\nthe only one standing in the Yangtze River."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260366,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它被江水环绕\ntā bèi jiāngshuǐ huánrào\nIt's surrounded by the river water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264166,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我觉得比较特别\nsuǒyǐ wǒ juéde bǐjiào tèbié\nwhich I find rather special"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266533,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比较吸引我\nbǐjiào xīyǐn wǒ\nand rather appealing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268366,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那也有的人把这座山叫做“江中浮玉”\nnà yě yǒude rén bǎ zhè zuò shān jiàozuò \"jiāng zhōng fú yù\"\nSome people also call this mountain \"Jade Afloat in the River\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273566,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是浮在江中的一块玉\njiùshì fú zài jiāng zhòngdì yīkuài yù\nmeaning a piece of jade floating on the river."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278166,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可以看到现在渡船向我们开过来了\nkěyǐ kàn dàoxiànzài dùchuán xiàng wǒmen kāi guòlai le\nYou can see the ferry heading our way now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289600,
    "dDurationMs": 2166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我们上船啦\nxiànzài wǒmen shàngchuán la\nNow we're going aboard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316200,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在准备靠岸\nxiànzài zhǔnbèi kàoàn\nWe're about to dock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321366,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我们到焦山门口了\nxiànzài wǒmen dào jiāo shānmén kǒu le\nNow we're at the entrance to Jiaoshan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326666,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这就是大门口\nzhè jiùshì dàmén kǒu\nThis is the main gate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330333,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "上面从右往左写着“焦山胜境”\nshàngmiàn cóng yòu wǎng zuǒ xiě zhe \"jiāo shān shèng jìng\"\nAbove it, written right to left, is \"Jiaoshan Shengjing\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337166,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“胜境”一般就是用来形容一个特别好\n\"shèng jìng\" yībān jiùshì yònglái xíngróng yígè tèbié hǎo\n\"Shengjing\" is generally used to describe a place that is especially fine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340366,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "特别美的地方\ntèbié měidí dìfāng\nespecially beautiful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343466,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们应该会注意到很多中国\nnǐmen yīnggāi huì zhùyì dào hěn duō zhōngguó\nYou've probably noticed that many Chinese"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346033,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "的景区都有这样的石狮子\nde jǐngqū dōu yǒu zhèyàng de shíshīzi\nscenic areas have stone lions like these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349566,
    "dDurationMs": 1467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实是一对\nqíshí shì yīduì\nThey actually come as a pair,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351966,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一公一母\nyī gōng yī mǔ\none male and one female."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355133,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "母狮子的脚下一般都有一头小狮子\nmǔ shīzi de jiǎoxià yībān dōu yǒu yītóu xiǎo shīzi\nUnder the female lion's paw there's usually a cub,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360966,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而公狮子的脚下一般都会踩着一个球\nér gōng shīzi de jiǎoxià yībān dūhuì cǎi zhe yígè qiú\nwhile the male lion usually has a ball under his."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369566,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边还有更多石雕的狮子\nzhèbiān háiyǒu gèng duō shídiāo de shīzi\nOver here there are even more carved stone lions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374733,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "撅着屁股的狮子\njuē zhe pìgu de shīzi\nLions with their rear ends stuck up in the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379333,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我们进了山\nxiànzài wǒmen jìn le shān\nNow that we're inside the mountain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381433,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为有了树荫\nyīnwèi yǒule shùyìn\nwith the shade of the trees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383866,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "终于感觉凉快多了\nzhōngyú gǎnjué liángkuai duō le\nit finally feels much cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391033,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边还有一个佛学院\nzhèbiān háiyǒu yígè fóxué yuàn\nThere's a Buddhist academy over here too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406966,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "再往前走就是一座寺庙\nzài wǎngqián zǒu jiùshì yī zuò sìmiào\nA little further on there's a temple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411000,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这座寺庙叫定慧寺\nzhè zuò sìmiào jiào dìng huì sì\nThis temple is called Dinghui Temple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414566,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有三个石桥通向它\nyǒu sānge shí qiáo tōngxiàng tā\nThree stone bridges lead up to it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420033,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "定慧寺后面又有一座塔\ndìng huì sì hòumiàn yòu yǒu yī zuò tǎ\nand behind Dinghui Temple there's a pagoda."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424733,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我进来\nxiànzài wǒ jìnlái\nNow that I've come inside,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426966,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "整体的感受就是\nzhěngtǐ de gǎnshòu jiùshì\nmy overall impression is that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429566,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "整个景区非常有层次\nzhěnggè jǐngqū fēicháng yǒu céngcì\nthe whole place has a wonderful sense of layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432633,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "走进来一层又一层的\nzǒujìn lái yīcéng yòu yīcéng de\nYou walk in and there's layer after layer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436566,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每一个地方都是景色\nměiyī gè dìfāng dōu shì jǐngsè\nand every single spot is a view in itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443133,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些都是用来烧香的\nzhèxiē dōu shì yònglái shāoxiāng de\nThese are all for burning incense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448633,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但可能因为今天是周一吧\ndàn kěnéng yīnwèi jīntiān shì zhōuyī ba\nBut maybe because today is Monday,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451833,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "没有什么人来烧香\nméiyǒushénme rén lái shāoxiāng\nhardly anyone has come to burn any."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455033,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你更多看到的是这里的\nnǐ gèng duō kàn dào de shì zhèlǐ de\nWhat you see more of are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457733,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "工作人员或者一些僧侣走来走去\ngōngzuòrényuán huòzhě yīxiē sēnglǔ zǒu lái zǒuqù\nthe staff here, or a few monks walking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464433,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "游客很少\nyóukè hěn shǎo\nThere are very few tourists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467400,
    "dDurationMs": 6666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们看这个寺庙前面也有一对石狮子\nnǐmen kàn zhège sìmiào qiánmiàn yě yǒu yīduì shíshīzi\nLook — in front of this temple there's also a pair of stone lions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474633,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "只不过比我们刚刚在\nzhǐbuguò bǐ wǒmen gānggang zài\nonly much smaller than the ones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476833,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "门口看到的小多了\nménkǒu kàn dào de xiǎo duō le\nwe saw at the gate just now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481000,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们发现了一只非常亲人的小猫\nwǒmen fāxiàn le yìzhī fēicháng qīnrén de xiǎomāo\nWe've found a very friendly little cat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486200,
    "dDurationMs": 4666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而且因为听说这上面有一些猫\nérqiě yīnwèi tīngshuō zhè shàngmiàn yǒuyīxiē māo\nAnd since I'd heard there were cats up here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490866,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我提前准备了食物（猫粮）\nsuǒyǐ wǒ tíqián zhǔnbèi le shíwù (māo liáng)\nI brought food with me in advance — cat food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496733,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "啊，等一下\na, děngyīxià\nAh, hold on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497733,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我解不开\nwǒ jiě bù kāi\nI can't get it open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506566,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但不知道他现在饿不饿\ndàn bùzhī dào tā xiànzài è bù è\nBut I don't know whether he's hungry right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510033,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "等一下哦\nděngyīxià ó\nHang on a second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513833,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "他现在躺下来了\ntā xiànzài tǎngxià lái le\nHe's lying down now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515800,
    "dDurationMs": 1266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "非常放松\nfēicháng fàngsōng\ncompletely relaxed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519733,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "等一下哦\nděngyīxià ó\nJust a moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524633,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我就放一点吧\nwǒ jiù fàng yīdiǎn ba\nI'll only put out a little,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526066,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不然把这边的环境弄脏了\nbùrán bǎ zhèbiān de huánjìng nòngzāng le\notherwise I'll make a mess of this place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542200,
    "dDurationMs": 1566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我觉得这边的人\ndàn wǒ juéde zhèbiān de rén\nBut I think the people here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543766,
    "dDurationMs": 5067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "应该也有在规律的喂它\nyīnggāi yě yǒu zài guīlù de wèi tā\nmust be feeding him regularly as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549766,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看起来被养的挺好的\nkànqǐlai bèi yǎng de tǐnghǎo de\nHe looks very well cared for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561733,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "吃完了\nchīwán le\nAll finished."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564466,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很满足的样子\nhěn mǎnzú de yàngzi\nHe looks thoroughly satisfied."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569833,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你想打招呼吗？\nnǐ xiǎng dǎzhāohu ma?\nDo you want to say hello?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580800,
    "dDurationMs": 5466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哇，你们看这边有一个龙的造型的钟\nwa, nǐmen kàn zhèbiān yǒu yígè lóng de zàoxíng de zhōng\nWow, look — there's a bell shaped like a dragon over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586966,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我猜应该是钟吧\nwǒ cāi yīnggāi shì zhōng ba\nI'm guessing it's a bell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588833,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "用来敲的\nyònglái qiāo de\nmeant to be struck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593166,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真的一个人都没有\nzhēn de yīgèrén dōu méiyǒu\nThere really isn't a single person around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595566,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我很少在寺庙有这样的体验\nwǒ hěn shǎo zài sìmiào yǒu zhèyàng de tǐyàn\nI've rarely had an experience like this at a temple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599600,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看来以后真的要选工作日来寺庙\nkànlai yǐhòu zhēn de yào xuǎn gōngzuòrì lái sìmiào\nIt seems I really should visit temples on weekdays from now on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605933,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "接下来我会安静的逛一会寺庙\njiēxiàlái wǒ huìān jìng de guàng yīhuì sìmiào\nNext I'm going to wander the temple quietly for a while,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609066,
    "dDurationMs": 2134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后把相机关掉\nránhòu bǎ xiàngjī guāndiào\nso I'll turn the camera off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613633,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我走到景区更里面了\nxiànzài wǒ zǒu dào jǐngqū gèng lǐmiàn le\nNow I've walked deeper into the scenic area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617433,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这边反而有更多人\nzhèbiān fǎnér yǒu gèng duō rén\nand there are actually more people here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620566,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "大家好像都在坐着乘凉休息\ndàjiā hǎoxiàng dōu zài zuò zhe chéngliáng xiūxi\nEveryone seems to be sitting in the shade, resting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624800,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可能因为天气真的太热了吧\nkěnéng yīnwèi tiānqì zhēn de tài rè le ba\nProbably because the weather really is too hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627966,
    "dDurationMs": 1067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们看\nnǐmen kàn\nTake a look —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629933,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从这个角度看刚刚的\ncóng zhège jiǎodù kàn gānggang de\nfrom this angle, the temple and the stone bridges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633266,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "寺院和石桥那一块好美啊\nsìyuàn hé shí qiáo nà yīkuài hǎo měi a\nwe saw just now look so beautiful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638766,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真的就像一幅画\nzhēn de jiù xiàng yī fú huà\nIt really is just like a painting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641800,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们走近一点\nwǒmen zǒujìn yīdiǎn\nLet's go a bit closer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648800,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这垂下来的树叶就像\nzhè chuíxià lái de shùyè jiù xiàng\nThese drooping leaves are like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652000,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "画框上的装饰一样\nhuàkuàng shàng de zhuāngshì yīyàng\ndecoration on a picture frame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656866,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我没想到这边还有一个\nwǒ méixiǎngdào zhèbiān háiyǒu yígè\nI didn't expect there to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663400,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "碑林\nbēilín\na forest of steles here as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666233,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这特别吸引我这样的书法爱好者\nzhè tèbié xīyǐn wǒ zhèyàng de shūfǎ àihàozhě\nThat's especially appealing to a calligraphy lover like me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671466,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "让我们进去看一下\nràng wǒmen jìnqù kàn yīxià\nLet's go in and take a look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687833,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这一块碑是清代乾隆皇帝留下的\nzhè yīkuài bēi shì qīngdài qiánlóng huángdì liúxià de\nThis stele was left by the Qianlong Emperor of the Qing dynasty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695800,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哇，你们看阳光透过这一个\nwa, nǐmen kàn yángguāng tòuguò zhè yígè\nWow, look at the sunlight coming through this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699533,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "花窗打在地上的阴影\nhuā chuāng dǎ zàidì shàng de yīnyǐng\nlatticed window and the shadows it casts on the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707466,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "又一只小猫\nyòu yìzhī xiǎomāo\nAnother little cat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711333,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这只白猫比起我一般\nzhè zhǐ bái māo bǐqǐ wǒ yībān\nThis white cat is much bolder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713400,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看到的白猫要大胆很多\nkàn dào de bái māo yào dàdǎn hěn duō\nthan the white cats I usually meet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718800,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一直闭着眼睛，打了个哈欠\nyīzhí bìzhe yǎnjing, dǎ le gè hāqian\nEyes shut the whole time — and there's a yawn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726066,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我没想到这座碑林这么大\nwǒ méixiǎngdào zhè zuò bēilín zhème dà\nI didn't expect this stele forest to be so big."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733066,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里面还有一些石桌子石椅子\nzhèlǐ miàn háiyǒu yīxiē shí zhuōzi shí yǐzi\nInside there are stone tables and stone stools,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737866,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有一个像茶室一样的地方\nháiyǒu yígè xiàng chá shì yīyàng de dìfāng\nand a spot that looks like a teahouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742466,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "整个碑林看起来就像一座小小的园林\nzhěnggè bēilín kànqǐlai jiù xiàng yī zuò xiǎoxiǎo de yuánlín\nThe whole stele forest looks like a miniature garden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753433,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "没想到这里面还藏着一片竹林\nméixiǎngdào zhèlǐ miàn hái cáng zhe yī piàn zhúlín\nI didn't expect a bamboo grove to be tucked away in here either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758366,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "特别茂密的竹子\ntèbié màomì de zhúzi\nWonderfully dense bamboo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761666,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就好像突然会有一只熊猫出现一样\njiù hǎoxiàng tūrán huì yǒu yìzhī xióngmāo chūxiàn yīyàng\nIt feels as if a panda might suddenly appear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767866,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里面还有更多更多的碑刻\nzhèlǐ miàn háiyǒu gèng duō gèng duō de bēikè\nAnd in here there are many, many more stone inscriptions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773133,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真是很安静的一片地呢\nzhēnshi hěn ānjìng de yī piàn dì ne\nIt really is such a quiet little place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781566,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那你们应该知道书法有不同的字体\nnà nǐmen yīnggāi zhīdào shūfǎ yǒu bùtóng de zìtǐ\nNow, you probably know that calligraphy has different scripts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786533,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "像这种比较规整的就是楷书\nxiàng zhèzhǒng bǐjiào guīzhěng de jiùshì kǎishū\nA neat, orderly one like this is regular script, kaishu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791800,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这种笔画之间连起来的\nzhèzhǒng bǐhuà zhījiān lián qilai de\nThis kind, with the strokes joined together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794866,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们可能有点看不懂的\nnǐmen kěnéng yǒudiǎn kànbudǒng de\nwhich you may find a little hard to read,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797333,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就叫行书\njiù jiào xíngshū\nis called running script, xingshu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799733,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果连的不那么厉害\nrúguǒ lián de bù nàme lìhai\nIf the strokes aren't joined quite so much,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802133,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们也会叫行楷\nwǒmen yě huì jiào xíng kǎi\nwe also call it xingkai — running-regular script."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807933,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不仅有刻字\nbùjǐn yǒu kè zì\nThere aren't only carved characters;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809566,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有像这样的刻画\nháiyǒu xiàng zhèyàng de kèhuà\nthere are carved pictures like this one too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812333,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这一位就是观音\nzhè yī wèi jiùshì guānyīn\nThis figure is Guanyin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814933,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对中国人来说很重要的神仙\nduì zhōngguórén lái shuō hěn zhòngyào de shénxiān\na deity very important to Chinese people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818266,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有梅花的刻画\nháiyǒu méihuā de kèhuà\nAnd here's a carving of plum blossom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821433,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它没有画一整棵树的梅花\ntā méiyǒu huà yī zhěng kē shù de méihuā\nRather than depicting a whole tree in blossom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825533,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而是画了其中的一枝\nérshì huà le qízhōng de yī zhī\nit shows just a single branch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829533,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这么这么多的竹子\nzhème zhème duō de zhúzi\nSo very much bamboo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831400,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真的让这个地方显得特别安静\nzhēn de ràng zhège dìfāng xiǎnde tèbié ānjìng\nreally does make this place feel especially quiet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835833,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "如果可以\nrúguǒ kěyǐ\nIf I could,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837400,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "真希望在这边待一整个下午\nzhēn xīwàng zài zhèbiān dài yī zhěnggè xiàwǔ\nI'd love to spend a whole afternoon here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840966,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而且这里面还特别凉快\nérqiě zhèlǐ miàn hái tèbié liángkuai\nAnd it's beautifully cool in here as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843866,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是现在已经3点多了\ndànshì xiànzài yǐjīng 3 diǎn duō le\nBut it's already past three o'clock,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846433,
    "dDurationMs": 5567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后从焦山回到市区的\nránhòu cóng jiāo shān huídào shìqū de\nand the last ferry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852933,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "渡船最晚的一班是5:45\ndùchuán zuì wǎn de yī bān shì 5: 45\nfrom Jiaoshan back to the city is at 5:45."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857600,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我现在要抓紧一点\nsuǒyǐ wǒ xiànzài yào zhuājǐn yīdiǎn\nSo I need to get a move on now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861033,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "马上爬到山顶去看一下那座塔\nmǎshàng pá dào shāndǐng qù kàn yīxià nà zuò tǎ\nand climb straight to the summit to see that pagoda."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866966,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎，人就是不能太贪心\nāi, rén jiùshì bùnéng tài tānxīn\nAh, you really mustn't be too greedy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870533,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "就是如果想要像我这样慢慢走慢慢看\njiùshì rúguǒ xiǎngyào xiàng wǒ zhèyàng mànmàn zǒu mànmàn kàn\nI mean, if you want to stroll and look slowly the way I do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875200,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还给你们录视频的话\nhuángěi nǐmen lù shìpín dehuà\nand film a video for you all as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878733,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "应该早上八九点就过来的\nyīnggāi zǎoshang bā jiǔ diǎn jiù guòlai de\nyou should come at eight or nine in the morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882200,
    "dDurationMs": 2266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可是我太懒了起不来\nkěshì wǒ tài lǎn le qǐ bù lái\nBut I'm too lazy to get up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885200,
    "dDurationMs": 933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看到了吗\nkàn dàoliǎo ma\nDid you see that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886133,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一只黑猫\nyìzhī hēi māo\nA black cat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890133,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你在吃什么\nnǐ zài chī shénme\nWhat are you eating?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894833,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你在做什么呢\nnǐ zài zuòshímǒ ne\nWhat are you up to?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897600,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你的牙齿痒吗\nnǐ de yáchǐ yǎng ma\nAre your teeth itchy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900333,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "没想到这里还藏着一个盆景园\nméixiǎngdào zhèlǐ hái cáng zhe yígè pénjǐng yuán\nI never expected a bonsai garden to be hidden here too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905433,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "天呐\ntiān nà\nOh my goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907366,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们可以告诉我焦山\nnǐmen kěyǐ gàosu wǒ jiāo shān\nCan you tell me — is there anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909166,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "还有什么地方是它没有的吗？\nháiyǒu shénmedìfang shì tā méiyǒu de ma?\nthat Jiaoshan doesn't have?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912466,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个地方真的值得逛一天\nzhège dìfāng zhēn de zhíde guàng yìtiān\nThis place really is worth a whole day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915800,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可惜我来的太晚了\nkěxī wǒ lái de tài wǎn le\nIt's a shame I came so late"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918400,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "只能选择性的逛一逛\nzhǐnéng xuǎnzéxìng de guàng yī guàng\nand can only pick and choose what to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922333,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不过本来旅游就是有\nbùguò běnlái lǔyóu jiùshì yǒu\nThen again, travelling always means"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925000,
    "dDurationMs": 1966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一些地方要错过的嘛\nyīxiē dìfāng yào cuòguò de ma\nthere are some places you have to miss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930766,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在这里应该就正式上山了\nxiànzài zhèlǐ yīnggāi jiù zhèngshì shàngshān le\nFrom here, I think, the climb officially begins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935166,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们走上台阶\nwǒmen zǒu shàngtái jiē\nLet's go up the steps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939133,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说实话我第一次看到这样的标识\nshuōshíhuà wǒ dìyīcì kàn dào zhèyàng de biāozhì\nTo be honest, it's the first time I've seen signs like these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943633,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "两个标识都是是告诉你上山\nliǎng gè biāozhì dōu shì shì gàosu nǐ shàngshān\nBoth signs just tell you \"up the mountain\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947133,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "而不是去哪个地方\nér bùshì qù nǎge dìfāng\nrather than where they actually lead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950166,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不知道这样的标识是否真的有意义\nbùzhī dào zhèyàng de biāozhì shìfǒu zhēn de yǒuyìyì\nI wonder whether signs like this are any use at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955833,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那我们选择这条上山之路吧\nnà wǒmen xuǎnzé zhè tiáo shàngshān zhī lù ba\nWell then, let's take this path up the mountain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962400,
    "dDurationMs": 1266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "爬山的时候\npáshān de shíhou\nWhen I'm climbing a mountain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963666,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我特别特别喜欢这些\nwǒ tèbié tèbié xǐhuan zhèxiē\nI especially, especially love this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966400,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从树叶之间照下来的阳光\ncóng shùyè zhījiān zhào xiàlai de yángguāng\nsunlight streaming down through the leaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973566,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从这边可以看到市区\ncóng zhèbiān kěyǐ kàn dào shìqū\nFrom here you can see the city,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976733,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是你能感觉到我们离市区很远\ndànshì nǐ néng gǎnjuédào wǒmen lí shìqū hěn yuǎn\nbut you can feel how far away from it we are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980033,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们隔绝了市区的噪音啊\nwǒmen géjué le shìqū de zàoyīn a\nWe're shut off from the city's noise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984866,
    "dDurationMs": 934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "污染啊\nwūrǎn a\nand its pollution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989466,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我觉得这座山应该不太高\ndàn wǒ juéde zhè zuò shān yīnggāi bù tài gāo\nBut I don't think this mountain is very tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993533,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "很快就可以爬到山顶了\nhěn kuài jiù kěyǐ pá dào shāndǐng le\nWe should reach the top before long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032433,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这座亭子的名字很有意思\nzhè zuò tíngzi de míngzi hěn yǒuyìsi\nThe name of this pavilion is rather interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041233,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "叫做“吸江楼”\njiàozuò \"xī jiāng lóu\"\nIt's called \"Xijiang Lou\" — the River-Drinking Tower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046033,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个就是“吸”\nzhège jiùshì \"xī\"\nThis character here means \"to draw in, to inhale\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048666,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "好像这座亭子要把旁边的\nhǎoxiàng zhè zuò tíngzi yào bǎ pángbiān de\nas if this pavilion were going to drink up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052333,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "长江的水全部吸进去一样\nchángjiāng de shuǐ quánbù xījìn qù yīyàng\nevery drop of the Yangtze River beside it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058933,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我感觉我到山顶了\nwǒ gǎnjué wǒ dào shāndǐng le\nI think I've made it to the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063266,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我觉得我的体力不如以前了\nwǒ juéde wǒ de tǐlì bùrú yǐqián le\nI feel my stamina isn't what it used to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066366,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可能因为前不久感染了新冠吧\nkěnéng yīnwèi qiánbùjiǔ gǎnrǎn le xīn guān ba\nMaybe because I caught COVID not long ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070066,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "对身体的打击真的很大\nduì shēntǐ de dǎjī zhēn de hěn dà\nIt really took a heavy toll on my body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081200,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "前面就是一座塔\nqiánmiàn jiùshì yī zuò tǎ\nJust ahead is a pagoda."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087766,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这座塔叫“万佛塔”\nzhè zuò tǎ jiào \"wàn fótǎ\"\nThis pagoda is called \"Wanfo Ta\" — the Ten Thousand Buddhas Pagoda,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090666,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为里面据说有一万尊佛像\nyīnwèi lǐmiàn jùshuō yǒu yī wàn zūn fóxiàng\nbecause it's said to hold ten thousand Buddha statues inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但它已经不是原来的塔了\ndàn tā yǐjīng bùshì yuánlái de tǎ le\nBut it's no longer the original pagoda;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099000,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "是重建的\nshì chóngjiàn de\nit's a reconstruction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101466,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "应该是有七层高\nyīnggāi shì yǒu qī céng gāo\nIt should be seven storeys high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104966,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们在这边还可以\nwǒmen zài zhèbiān hái kěyǐ\nFrom here we can also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106466,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "看到远处的江景和市区\nkàn dào yuǎnchù de jiāng jǐng hé shìqū\nsee the river and the city in the distance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119633,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是这座万佛塔看起来好像不能进去\ndànshì zhè zuò wàn fótǎ kànqǐlai hǎoxiàng bùnéng jìnqù\nBut it seems you can't go inside this Ten Thousand Buddhas Pagoda."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127000,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "门上上了锁\nmén shàng shàng le suǒ\nThe door is locked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129433,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但我能通过这个门缝看到里面\ndàn wǒ néng tōngguò zhège mén fèng kàn dào lǐmiàn\nStill, I can see in through the crack in the door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134366,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "里面在施工\nlǐmiàn zài shīgōng\nThere's construction going on inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136366,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "难怪不能进去呢\nnánguài bùnéng jìnqù ne\nNo wonder you can't go in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142333,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在下午4:15\nxiànzài xiàwǔ 4: 15\nIt's now 4:15 in the afternoon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145866,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我准备下山啦\nwǒ zhǔnbèi xiàshān la\nand I'm getting ready to head back down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151866,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我们下来了\nxiànzài wǒmen xiàlai le\nNow we've come down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153733,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "到江边了\ndào jiāngbiān le\nto the riverside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155866,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在这里可以欣赏江景\nzài zhèlǐ kěyǐ xīnshǎng jiāng jǐng\nFrom here you can take in the river view."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159333,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "虽然已经下午4点多了\nsuīrán yǐjīng xiàwǔ 4 diǎn duō le\nEven though it's already past four in the afternoon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161200,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是太阳还是挺晒的\ndànshì tàiyang háishi tǐng shài de\nthe sun is still pretty fierce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167600,
    "dDurationMs": 1366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但说实话\ndàn shuōshíhuà\nBut to be honest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169333,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从这这座江中小山往\ncóng zhè zhè zuò jiāng zhōng xiǎo shān wǎng\nthe view looking out into the distance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174166,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "远处看的景色并不怎么好\nyuǎnchù kàn de jǐngsè bìngbù zěnme hǎo\nfrom this little mountain in the river isn't all that special —"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177833,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它自己本身就是江上最好的景色\nyīnwèi tā zìjǐ běnshēn jiùshì jiāng shàng zuìhǎo de jǐngsè\nbecause the mountain itself is the best view on the river."
    } ]
  } ]
}
